{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eda630a8-1c85-82bc-86d7-2675935a5b30",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T10:10:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Paula Resendes. I have a question about a fence. I am not sure I am calling the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fences are us, so you're in the right place. Tell me what you're planning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, my old fence is rotted. It is very old, wood, falling down in pieces. I want to take it out and put a new one in the same spot, the same line. The property is sixteen Pelham Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sixteen Pelham, up on the Hill. And what kind of new fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black aluminum. Four feet tall. The man who will do the work says he can start next week, so I want to ask you, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence needs a permit, even a replacement. And on the Hill you may also have historic district review, depending on what's visible from the street. Is this the front of the house or the side or back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The front and one side. Along the sidewalk. Why is it, if it is the same place, the same fence? I do not change anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, it feels like the same thing. But the city still wants to see the height and material and make sure it sits where it's supposed to. Same footprint helps, though. It keeps things simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:08:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. And how long does the approval take? He says next week, but maybe he is too fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a plain fence permit, usually a week or two. If it has to go to the historic folks, that can add time. So I'd tell him to hold off until you have the paper in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I will tell him to wait. What do I need to bring? A drawing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A simple sketch of the property showing where the fence goes, the height, and the material. A photo of the existing fence is helpful too. Is the property in your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my name. It is for my business, also, downstairs. Resendes, you want me to spell it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, so I get it right on the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "R, E, S, E, N, D, E, S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the street, Pelham, P, E, L, H, A, M."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:09:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And you said the application form is, I mean, I'll point you to it. You can pick one up here or find it on the city website under the building permit forms."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The forms, the word, F, O, R, M, S? Or you said four, like the number? Because my fence is four feet. I am confused, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's my fault. Forms, F-O-R-M-S, the paperwork. Your fence is four, the number. Two different words that sound alike."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yes. Forms is paper. Four is the height. Okay. Now I understand, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So, sketch, photo, application, and tell your fence guy to wait. Do you want me to note a number in case someone from the office needs to call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Perfect. We're open until four-thirty today if you want to stop in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Anita. I will come maybe this afternoon. God bless you and your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T10:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, and you take care. Bye now."
    }
  ],
